    <string name="repair_confirm_body">Start over removes the Launcher\'s game environment: the installed Diablo II, Lord of Destruction and Project Diablo 2 files and their settings. Your characters are kept: they live in a folder of their own. Everything already downloaded is kept, so reinstalling doesn\'t download it again. You\'ll need your CD keys again to reinstall.</string>

